Implement ⟪GTI18N_32149682_000001⟫WordCount⟪GTI18N_32149682_000002⟫.  It should return a map of the counts of each “word” in the string ⟪GTI18N_32149682_000003⟫s⟪GTI18N_32149682_000004⟫. The ⟪GTI18N_32149682_000005⟫wc.Test⟪GTI18N_32149682_000006⟫ function runs a test suite against the provided function and prints success or failure.

